# Sages-fork .gitignore for the pi-routines workspace package.
#
# Mirrors the upstream's vendoring intent: source and metadata live in
# the repository, install artifacts do not. The Sages root .gitignore
# also matches `**/node_modules/`, but we duplicate the rule here so a
# `git status` from inside `pi-routines/` stays quiet without the root
# context.

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Install lockfile — regenerated on every `pnpm install`; the upstream
# ships one in their own tree because they pin their dev env there, but
# Sages consumers all share `bun.lock` and explicit `pnpm install`s. The
# fork intentionally tracks NO `pnpm-lock.yaml`; CI relies on the
# pinned versions in `package.json` + `node_modules/` resolution.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# pnpm 11 sometimes auto-generates a tiny `pnpm-workspace.yaml` carrying
# `allowBuilds:` choices. Reject it; build approvals live upstream.
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Sages orchestrator state — must not be tracked even if the package
# were ever lifted into its own checkout.
.pi/
